        "content": "<p>xia-chao opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/15058\">PR #15058</a> from <code>xia-chao:wasi-tls-write-permit</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The TLS output stream let a write go past the permit returned by check-write. It traps now.</p>\n<p>check-write is what tells a guest how much it can write without blocking, so a write above that number has to trap instead of being accepted.<br>\n</p>\n</blockquote>",
